      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Can I play Slitherlink on mobile?</summary>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. The board scales to any screen and works in any modern browser on iOS and Android. On phones and tablets, just tap the line segments between dots to draw them, and tap again to erase.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Are all GridPaw Slitherlink puzzles solvable without guessing?</summary>
